<view class="vet-page user-page">
  <!-- 账户面板：白底卡片 -->
  <view class="account-panel vet-fade-up" style="animation-delay:0ms">
    <view class="account-inner">
      <view class="user-avatar-wrap">
        <image wx:if="{{user && user.avatarUrl}}" class="user-avatar-img" src="{{user.avatarUrl}}" mode="aspectFill" />
        <view wx:else class="user-avatar-placeholder">{{user ? user.avatarText : '本'}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="user-copy">
        <view class="user-name">{{currentSpaceName}}</view>
        <view class="user-desc">你的问诊记录会保存在本机，注意保护隐私。</view>
        <view class="space-id" bindtap="showStorageHelp">
          <text class="space-id-label">空间 ID</text>
          <text class="space-id-value">{{currentSpaceId}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 数据概览：三格统计 -->
  <view class="data-summary vet-fade-up" style="animation-delay:60ms">
    <view class="summary-cell" bindtap="goRecords">
      <view class="summary-value text-numeric">{{recordsCount}}</view>
      <view class="summary-label">累计问诊</view>
    </view>
    <view class="summary-cell" bindtap="goProfiles">
      <view class="summary-value text-numeric">{{profilesCount}}</view>
      <view class="summary-label">宠物档案</view>
    </view>
    <view class="summary-cell">
      <view class="summary-value recent text-numeric">{{recentText}}</view>
      <view class="summary-label">最近一次</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 产品设置 -->
  <view class="settings-section vet-fade-up" style="animation-delay:120ms">
    <view class="section-heading">
      <view class="section-title">产品设置</view>
      <view class="section-note">{{storageModeText}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="settings-list">
      <view class="setting-item {{expandedSection === 'model' ? 'expanded' : ''}}" bindtap="toggleSection" data-key="model">
        <view class="setting-row">
          <view class="setting-title">默认模型</view>
          <view class="setting-chevron {{expandedSection === 'model' ? 'open' : ''}}">›</view>
        </view>
        <view class="setting-detail" wx:if="{{expandedSection === 'model'}}">
          <text>当前初筛报告使用 Qwen3.7-Plus。模型 provider、请求地址和 API 配置由项目配置决定，本页面不修改业务调用。</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="setting-item {{expandedSection === 'quality' ? 'expanded' : ''}}" bindtap="toggleSection" data-key="quality">
        <view class="setting-row">
          <view class="setting-title">图片质量</view>
          <view class="setting-chevron {{expandedSection === 'quality' ? 'open' : ''}}">›</view>
        </view>
        <view class="setting-detail" wx:if="{{expandedSection === 'quality'}}">
          <text>上传图片会先进行压缩和基础质量检查。建议使用光线充足、对焦清晰、能看到整体部位和近景细节的照片。</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="setting-item {{expandedSection === 'privacy' ? 'expanded' : ''}}" bindtap="toggleSection" data-key="privacy">
        <view class="setting-row">
          <view class="setting-title">隐私与数据</view>
          <view class="setting-chevron {{expandedSection === 'privacy' ? 'open' : ''}}">›</view>
        </view>
        <view class="setting-detail" wx:if="{{expandedSection === 'privacy'}}">
          <text>当前空间：{{currentSpaceName}}
空间 ID：{{currentSpaceId}}
记录和档案只按本机空间分开保存，换手机或重装后不会同步。</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="setting-item {{expandedSection === 'disclaimer' ? 'expanded' : ''}}" bindtap="toggleSection" data-key="disclaimer">
        <view class="setting-row">
          <view class="setting-title">免责声明</view>
          <view class="setting-chevron {{expandedSection === 'disclaimer' ? 'open' : ''}}">›</view>
        </view>
        <view class="setting-detail" wx:if="{{expandedSection === 'disclaimer'}}">
          <text>1. 本工具结果仅供参考，不构成医疗诊断。
2. 请在兽医指导下进行宠物疾病治疗。
3. 紧急情况请立即前往宠物医院。
4. 本工具不对使用结果承担任何诊疗责任。</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="setting-item {{expandedSection === 'feedback' ? 'expanded' : ''}}" bindtap="toggleSection" data-key="feedback">
        <view class="setting-row">
          <view class="setting-title">反馈建议</view>
          <view class="setting-chevron {{expandedSection === 'feedback' ? 'open' : ''}}">›</view>
        </view>
        <view class="setting-detail" wx:if="{{expandedSection === 'feedback'}}">
          <text>你可以在结果页提交报告是否有帮助，也可以导出数据后整理问题反馈给开发者。</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="setting-item {{expandedSection === 'about' ? 'expanded' : ''}}" bindtap="toggleSection" data-key="about">
        <view class="setting-row">
          <view class="setting-title">关于 VetAI</view>
          <view class="setting-chevron {{expandedSection === 'about' ? 'open' : ''}}">›</view>
        </view>
        <view class="setting-detail" wx:if="{{expandedSection === 'about'}}">
          <text>VetAI 宠物皮肤初筛 v{{appVersion}}

用于整理宠物皮肤照片、症状描述和就医沟通参考。

结果仅供初步观察，不能替代线下兽医诊断。</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 数据管理 -->
  <view class="settings-section vet-fade-up" style="animation-delay:180ms">
    <view class="section-heading">
      <view class="section-title">数据管理</view>
      <view class="section-note">仅作用于当前本机空间</view>
    </view>
    <view class="settings-list">
      <view class="setting-item" bindtap="goProfiles">
        <view class="setting-copy">
          <view class="setting-title">宠物档案</view>
        </view>
        <view class="setting-arrow"></view>
      </view>
      <view class="setting-item" bindtap="goRecords">
        <view class="setting-copy">
          <view class="setting-title">历史记录</view>
        </view>
        <view class="setting-arrow"></view>
      </view>
      <view class="setting-item" bindtap="exportData">
        <view class="setting-copy">
          <view class="setting-title">导出数据</view>
        </view>
        <view class="setting-arrow"></view>
      </view>
      <view class="setting-item danger" bindtap="clearData">
        <view class="setting-copy">
          <view class="setting-title">清除数据</view>
        </view>
        <view class="setting-arrow"></view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 空间操作 -->
  <view class="space-actions vet-fade-up" style="animation-delay:240ms">
    <button class="vet-btn vet-btn-secondary space-btn" bindtap="switchSpace">切换 / 新建本机空间</button>
    <view wx:if="{{user}}" class="switch-guest-link" bindtap="logout">切回本机访客</view>
  </view>
</view>
